  "desc": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255)\">巡宇翦定 · 恰斯卡</span></p><p>風花鏗鏘，飛羽凌空。</p>",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/03/19/84496276/c53f37f670e7d1c7d6e8d01937ad5e97_6400938353075225249.png",
